Before We Start — Feel the Difference You&rsquo;re about to learn Java 8. Before diving into history and theory, let&rsquo;s just feel what changed. Here&rsquo;s the same task written in Java 7 and Java 8:
Task: Find all names that start with &ldquo;A&rdquo;, uppercase them, sort them, and collect into a list.
// Java 7 — 10 lines, two passes, one temporary variable, zero joy List&lt;String&gt; result = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;(); for (String name : names) { if (name.
